This one may take a while to complete the install.
First, set your clock. These printers don't have an RTC so you need to use rdate. You'll need this for TLS verification down the line
`rdate -s time.nist.gov`
You can also add this to your `/usr/prog/app_startup.sh` if you want it to do it on boot:
